#: ../../source/howto-custom-algorithm.rst:4
msgid "How to: implement a custom algorithm"
msgstr "操作指南：实现一个自定义算法"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-algorithm.rst:6
msgid ""
"Built-in algorithms cover the classics, but research lives in the "
"variations. This guide implements a complete algorithm — a FedProx "
"variant with named parameter exchange and optional variance reduction — "
"walking through every file you need and every hook you can override. The "
"running example is ``test-files/custom_alg.py``; the code shown below is "
"included from that file, so it is exercised in CI (the CLI runs it via "
"``test-files/custom_conf.yml``)."
msgstr ""
"内置算法覆盖了经典方法，但研究的天地在变体里。本指南实现一个完整算法——带按名参数"
"交换与可选方差削减的 FedProx 变体——走遍你需要的每个文件与每个可覆写的钩子。贯穿示例是 "
"``test-files/custom_alg.py``；下文展示的代码都从该文件引入，因此在 CI 中真实执行"
"（CLI 经 ``test-files/custom_conf.yml`` 运行它）。"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-algorithm.rst:14
msgid ""
"The one-sentence model: **an algorithm is two config classes plus hook "
"overrides on the Server and Client classes** — the training loop, the "
"communication schedule scaffolding, logging, evaluation and the parallel "
"executors all stay untouched (:doc:`concepts` explains why)."
msgstr ""
"一句话模型： **算法 = 一对配置类 + Server/Client 类上的钩子覆写** ——训练循环、"
"通信调度脚手架、日志、评估、并行执行器全部原样（ :doc:`concepts` 解释了为什么）。"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-algorithm.rst:20
msgid "When do you need this?"
msgstr "什么时候需要它？"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-algorithm.rst:22
msgid ""
"your algorithm changes **what clients compute** locally (new local "
"objective, extra local state) → override client hooks;"
msgstr "算法改变了客户端 **本地计算的内容** （新的本地目标、额外的本地状态）→ 覆写客户端钩子；"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-algorithm.rst:24
msgid ""
"it changes **what is exchanged or how replies are aggregated** → override"
" server hooks;"
msgstr "算法改变了 **交换的内容或回复的聚合方式** → 覆写服务器钩子；"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-algorithm.rst:26
msgid "it needs **new hyperparameters** → add config fields."
msgstr "算法需要 **新的超参数** → 添加配置字段。"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-algorithm.rst:28
msgid ""
"If you only need different *values* for existing hyperparameters, no code"
" is needed — use the built-in algorithm's config."
msgstr "如果只是想给既有超参数设不同的 *值* ，不需要写任何代码——直接用内置算法的配置。"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-algorithm.rst:32
msgid "The config classes"
msgstr "配置类"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-algorithm.rst:34
msgid ""
"Two pydantic models, one for each side. New fields become CLI/CLI-YAML "
"options automatically; ``server_config_kw_doc`` / "
"``client_config_kw_doc`` append the inherited fields' docs so the API "
"reference stays complete:"
msgstr ""
"两个 pydantic 模型，各管一侧。新字段自动成为 CLI/YAML 选项； ``server_config_kw_doc`` / "
"``client_config_kw_doc`` 把继承字段的文档追加进来，API 参考得以保持完整："

#: ../../source/howto-custom-algorithm.rst:43
msgid ""
"The ``model_validator`` here fixes the local optimizer from the ``vr`` "
"flag — config-level invariants belong in validators, so invalid "
"combinations fail at construction, not mid-run."
msgstr ""
"这里的 ``model_validator`` 由 ``vr`` 标志固定本地优化器——配置级不变式就该放在 "
"validator 里，让非法组合在构造时失败，而不是跑到一半。"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-algorithm.rst:48
msgid "The server hooks"
msgstr "服务器钩子"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-algorithm.rst:50
msgid ""
"The server customizes the **downlink** (``communicate``) and the "
"**aggregation** (``update``). Everything else — sampling, the round loop,"
" metrics — is inherited:"
msgstr ""
"服务器定制 **下行** （ ``communicate`` ）与 **聚合** （ ``update`` ）。其余一切——"
"采样、轮循环、指标——全部继承："

#: ../../source/howto-custom-algorithm.rst:59
msgid "Points worth noting:"
msgstr "值得注意的点："

#: ../../source/howto-custom-algorithm.rst:61
msgid ""
"``communicate(target)`` builds a typed "
":class:`~fl_sim.messages.ServerToClient` message; ``extras`` carries "
"algorithm-specific payloads (here, server-side gradients for variance "
"reduction) alongside the model."
msgstr ""
"``communicate(target)`` 构建带类型的 :class:`~fl_sim.messages.ServerToClient` 消息；"
"``extras`` 携带算法特有载荷（此处是方差削减用的服务器侧梯度），与模型并列。"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-algorithm.rst:64
msgid ""
"``update()`` runs on the main thread after the sampled clients' replies "
"arrive in ``self._received_messages`` — in sampled-client order, which is"
" what keeps aggregation bitwise identical across "
":doc:`parallel_execution` backends."
msgstr ""
"``update()`` 在主线程上运行，此时被采样客户端的回复已进入 ``self._received_messages``"
"——按被采样客户端顺序排列，这正是聚合在所有 :doc:`parallel_execution` 后端上逐位一致的"
"原因。"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-algorithm.rst:68
msgid ""
"``client_cls`` and ``config_cls`` wire the custom classes together; "
"``@register_algorithm()`` (shown above each class) makes the algorithm "
"usable by name."
msgstr ""
"``client_cls`` 与 ``config_cls`` 把自定义类互相接起来； ``@register_algorithm()`` "
"（见各类上方）让算法可按名字使用。"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-algorithm.rst:73
msgid "The client hooks"
msgstr "客户端钩子"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-algorithm.rst:75
msgid ""
"The client customizes the **local training** (``update``) and the "
"**uplink** (``communicate``):"
msgstr "客户端定制 **本地训练** （ ``update`` ）与 **上行** （ ``communicate`` ）："

#: ../../source/howto-custom-algorithm.rst:83
msgid ""
"The most important contract on this page is in ``communicate``: it "
"**builds and returns** a :class:`~fl_sim.messages.ClientToServer` and "
"touches nothing but the client's own state. The framework sends the "
"message and maintains the communication counters. That is what makes the "
"hook safe to run inside a worker thread when :doc:`parallel execution "
"<parallel_execution>` is on — a hook that reached into server state would"
" only work sequentially."
msgstr ""
"本页最重要的契约在 ``communicate`` 里：它 **构建并返回** 一个 "
":class:`~fl_sim.messages.ClientToServer`，除客户端自身状态外不碰任何东西。消息的发送"
"与通信计数由框架维护。正因如此，开启 :doc:`并行执行 <parallel_execution>` 时该钩子才能"
"安全地跑在工作线程里——一个伸手去碰服务器状态的钩子只能在串行模式下工作。"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-algorithm.rst:92
msgid "Named exchange, by the way"
msgstr "顺带说一句：按名交换"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-algorithm.rst:94
msgid ""
"This example exchanges parameters **by name** (a ``model_state`` mapping "
"from parameter name to tensor, i.e. :data:`~fl_sim.messages.ModelState`) "
"instead of the legacy flat positional list. Names survive reordering and "
"partial modules, and the loading side (``accept_parameters``, ``update``)"
" looks parameters up by name. The flat-list style still works everywhere;"
" prefer names for new algorithms."
msgstr ""
"本示例按 **参数名** 交换参数（ ``model_state`` 映射：参数名 → 张量，即 "
":data:`~fl_sim.messages.ModelState` ），而不是遗留的扁平位置列表。名字能扛住重排序与"
"部分模块，加载侧（ ``accept_parameters`` 、 ``update`` ）按名查找。扁平列表写法依然处处"
"可用；但新算法请优先用名字。"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-algorithm.rst:102
msgid "Register and run"
msgstr "注册与运行"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-algorithm.rst:104
msgid ""
"``@register_algorithm()`` (applied to all four classes above) puts the "
"algorithm into the registry; from then on the CLI and YAML matrices "
"accept it like any built-in:"
msgstr ""
"``@register_algorithm()`` （上面四个类都应用了）把算法送进注册表；此后 CLI 与 YAML "
"矩阵像对待内置算法一样接受它："

#: ../../source/howto-custom-algorithm.rst:118
msgid ""
"The same four classes work programmatically, exactly like "
":doc:`quickstart`:"
msgstr "同样这四个类也可以编程方式使用，与 :doc:`quickstart` 完全一致："

#: ../../source/howto-custom-algorithm.rst:129
msgid "How your algorithm is kept honest"
msgstr "你的算法如何被守护"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-algorithm.rst:131
msgid "Two layers protect a registered algorithm:"
msgstr "两层机制守护一个注册算法："

#: ../../source/howto-custom-algorithm.rst:133
msgid ""
"the **golden regression** suite (``test/test_parallel_equivalence/``) "
"pins each algorithm's observable trajectory (messages, decisions, "
"counters, metrics positions) so refactors cannot silently change "
"behavior;"
msgstr ""
" **golden 回归** 套件（ ``test/test_parallel_equivalence/`` ）钉住每个算法的可观测轨迹"
"（消息、决策、计数器、指标位置），重构无法悄悄改变行为；"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-algorithm.rst:137
msgid ""
"the **hook contract test** (``test/test_hook_contract.py``) asserts that "
"client hooks touch no server state — the parallel-safety property "
"``communicate`` above was written for."
msgstr ""
" **钩子契约测试** （ ``test/test_hook_contract.py`` ）断言客户端钩子不触碰服务器状态"
"——上面 ``communicate`` 的并行安全性质正是为此而写。"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-algorithm.rst:141
msgid "When you add an algorithm to the repository itself, add it to both."
msgstr "把算法合入本仓库时，两层都要接入。"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-algorithm.rst:144
msgid "Legacy hook style"
msgstr "遗留钩子写法"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-algorithm.rst:146
msgid ""
"Older code overrides ``communicate(self, target)`` on the *client* and "
"mutates server state directly. It still works under the sequential "
"backend (with a ``DeprecationWarning``), but it is incompatible with "
"parallel backends and will be removed; new algorithms should build and "
"return the typed message as shown above."
msgstr ""
"更老的代码在 *客户端* 上覆写 ``communicate(self, target)`` 并直接改动服务器状态。它在"
"串行后端下仍然可用（会带 ``DeprecationWarning`` ），但与并行后端不兼容，终将移除；"
"新算法请按上文所示构建并返回带类型的消息。"

